    "describe_ch": "此課程將傳授學生基礎物理概念與知識，以利未來專業科目之修習。內容包含電學、磁學、與光學三個主題。\n",
    "describe_eh": "General physics provides knowledge basis for all science and engineering students required for their advanced courses. The topics of this course include electricity, magnetism, and optics.",
